# Keeps the website image's build context (repo root -- it needs apps/desktop, apps/web,
# AND apps/website together, see infra/website.Dockerfile) from including the Rust build
# output (tens of GB), every node_modules tree (reinstalled fresh inside the image), and
# anything else no Dockerfile in this repo actually needs.
.git
**/node_modules
apps/desktop/src-tauri/target
apps/desktop/src-tauri/gen
services/api/__pycache__
services/api/.pytest_cache
**/__pycache__
**/dist
**/.next
apps/promo-video/out
